stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open
    [*] --> Fenced
    Open --> Decided: result or counsel answer recorded
    Open --> Killed: pre-registered kill criterion fires
    Fenced --> Live: blocker clears and the artefact ships
    Fenced --> CarvedOut: blocker still open at its gate
    CarvedOut --> Live: blocker clears and the artefact ships later
    Decided --> Reopened: registered watch trigger fires
    Live --> Reopened: registered watch trigger fires
    Reopened --> Decided: re-verification complete
    Reopened --> Killed: kill criterion fires
    Killed --> [*]
